  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A grayscale airbrush scene of small pod figures standing on rooftops and in the street among soft grey apartment buildings, with a bare tree.",
    "description": "A square airbrush painting on cream paper, grey only. A cluster of apartment buildings with rows of window slots rises in the middle of the sheet, rendered in soft grey gradients with no outlines, including a tower at right with stacked windows, a central block with a zigzag parapet, and lower blocks at left. Small pod figures with visor faces stand on the rooftops, in doorways, and in a group of five along the bottom edge. A bare forked tree grows from a mid level roof and a column of scribbled leaves hangs at the right edge. The buildings sit on a soft grey ground shape that fades to the paper.",
    "impression": "The pod people at home: a tenement block where everybody is out on the roof or the stoop. Without colour it looks like a dream of a city, or a model city made of felt. Quiet and companionable, a neighbourhood more than a skyline.",
